  "catalogId": "https://uicockpit.com/a2ui/v1/public-service/catalog.json",
  "instructions": "# Public-service catalog\n\nPrefer a component to prose. A list of facts is **SummaryList**, the steps of a service are **TaskList** (with a status per step) or **Steps** (what to do, in order), a thing the reader must not miss is **Callout**, rows of the same shape are a **Table** — and a Table always declares its `columns`.\n\nRules: one primary **Button** per answer · headings go 2 then 3, never skip · a status word travels in text, never in colour alone · never a Card inside a Card.",
